        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AD-F2, Keyed Entry Traditional Drop Tail Levers</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA simplistic lever, Fusion Hardware's Drop Tail Lever Entry is great for both traditional and modern style homes. It is available in brushed nickel, oil rubbed bronze, and lifetime polished brass finishes. A grade 1 keyed entry lever, the Drop Tail Exterior Lever will fit doors from 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches thick. It has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. And even though it is called exterior lever, it can be used on the interior as well, making this door lever with lock just as useful as a bathroom door handle as it is a front door lock.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis <b>Single Cylinder</b> Keyed Entry Lever is operated by a key on the outside and a push-button on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion AD-F2 Grade 1 Grade 1 Drop Tail Levers and Traditional Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Construction</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Levers are field reversible</li>\r\n<li>Bump and pick resistant lock cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Certified ANSI/BHMA Grade 2 Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw assembly for sleek appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway & pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Traditional Keyed Door Lever Fusion AD  F2:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Function: Single Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Schlage C keyway</li>\r\n<li>Includes 2 homeowner keys.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Keyed Drop Tail Exterior Lever",
                "description": "A simplistic lever, Fusion Hardware's Drop Tail Lever Entry is great for both traditional and modern style homes. It is available in brushed nickel, oil rubbed bronze, and lifetime polished brass finishes. A grade 1 keyed entry lever, the Drop Tail Exterior Lever will fit doors from 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches thick. It has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. ",
